/trade - Basic command
/trade accept (playerName) (-s) - Accept offer
/trade block [playerName] - Block player
/trade checkperm (key word) - Check possible permission nodes
/trade deny [playername] - Deny trade offer
/trade force [playername] [playername] (-s) - Force a trade between 2 players
/trade log [username] - Check your own or players trade logs
/trade logitems (username) - Check your own or players traded items
/trade offer [playername] (-s) - Send trade offer
/trade purge [TimeInMinutes] - Clears database to specific point
/trade reload - Reload config and locale file
/trade set [path] [variable] - Change config setings
/trade toggle - Toggle trades
